  "id": "perspective-taking",
  "term": "perspective taking",
  "definition": "Perspective taking is the mental process of understanding another person’s viewpoint or mindset from one’s own position. In psychology, it is often treated as the cognitive side of empathy, distinct from the emotional side but closely related to it.",
